{"v":4,"catch":"MAZIN GO!!\n你贏得了無與倫比的力量！！","desc":"“MAZINGER Z”是 BANPRESTO（“Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.”）於 1994 年發布的射擊遊戲。\n控制 Mazinger Z、Great Mazinger 和 Grendizer，使用射擊、拳擊和超級武器來對抗Dr. Hell的地下帝國！ 一次最多支持兩名玩家。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-05-11","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95ba7638d22cbc2eb958d0de2cccb4a31c20faff0097dfb6863b3c2820c8677e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/065ef60374d1bad2fb1c5564604d456349520e3884fbbef487ee20e44fb90f83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c4762ec660b1a9f2acdecb421fc705a913adff31e943e49b6502bd1c0d463b39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/612364cbc7f6c32f2d9f07f862bc3b86dfcc1c0b656acad9eac0e41ecc0e4b9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03963a8a95192ae84f44f72a0b5a5edc5b0f0f9ee80ca4f0693a9872a251166d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/710b47e99947fb9f50f7c51343979b51be2e9f4c25551a82b6ffcd325846dfaa.jpg"],"titleId":"010063601ac88000","dlc":[]}